<code>assert coll != null => this.size() == coll.size() && \forall E e; coll.contains(e); this.contains(e);</code>

This assert statement checks that if the input collection `coll` is not null, then the size of the queue after construction is equal to the size of the collection, and every element in the collection is contained in the queue.
